Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Checkmate. -Aaarggh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.07,0:00:28.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:30.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.49,0:00:30.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你又赢了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:33.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Obviously, you're not well suited for three-dimensional chess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:33.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然你没玩立体西洋棋的天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:37.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps three-dimensional Candy Land would be more your speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.91,0:00:37.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许立体的糖果乐园游戏比较适合你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just reset the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:43.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It must be humbling to suck on so many different levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:43.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在各个层次都不在行 你一定觉得很羞耻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:49.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:50.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. -Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:50.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 你们好 -嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Get my mail? -Yeah, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.55,0:00:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们有帮我收信吗？ -有的 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How was Nebraska? -Well, better than North Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.01,0:00:54.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}内布拉斯加州如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比北达科他州强多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:05.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess that joke's only funny in Nebraska.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:05.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这笑话大概只在内布拉斯加州才好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}From the data at hand, you can't draw that conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就目前掌握的资料 你不能妄下如此断论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:11.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All you can say with absolute certainty is that that joke is not funny here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:11.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你只能确定这笑话在这里一点都不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, it's good to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.87,0:01:19.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 我真高兴回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How's your family? -Oh, it was the worst trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.62,0:01:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你的家人如何？ -这次回家一点也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Everyone got sick over the weekend. -Sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.92,0:01:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这周末每个人都病了 -病了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What kind of sick? -Oh, the flu, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么病？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜是流感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't need you to guess, I need you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:34.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要的不是猜测 是确切的结论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, when did the symptoms first appear?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}症状是什么时候开始出现的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.01,0:01:38.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许是周五吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friday. Was that morning or afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.43,0:01:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周五 是早上还是下午？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't-- -Think, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:43.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不… -用力想 女人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:45.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Who blew their nose and when?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:45.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有谁擤过鼻涕？几点擤的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:48.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, relax. She doesn't have any symptoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:48.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 别紧张 她没有任何症状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:49.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure she's not contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.23,0:01:49.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她肯定没被传染
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:51.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:51.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If influenza was only contagious after symptoms appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果流行性感冒只在症状出现后才具感染性
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it would've died out years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那它早在几千年前就销声匿迹了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Somewhere between tool using and cave painting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在能人学会使用工具和进行洞穴绘画期间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Homo habilis would've figured out to kill the guy with the runny nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.08,0:02:03.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们早就想出办法杀掉那些流鼻涕的家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, you'll have to excuse Sheldon. He's a bit of a germaphobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 别在意谢尔顿 他有点恐菌症
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:08.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's okay. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.42,0:02:08.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 我可以理解
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for your consideration. Now please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多谢你的体谅 请你快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'd better go before he starts spraying you with Lysol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:16.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你最好赶紧走 免得他用清洗剂喷你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, thank you for getting my mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.34,0:02:18.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧…谢谢你帮我拿信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:20.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, problem. Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:20.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气 欢迎你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CAN SPRAYING]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.44,0:02:29.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在搞什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:05.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm making petri dishes to grow throat cultures.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:05.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正在用培养皿培育咽喉培检菌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With lime Jell-O?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用青柠果冻？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need a growth medium, and someone polished off the apricot yogurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要培养基 但有人把杏仁酸奶喝光了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here. Swab my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:15.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来 帮我刮一下喉咙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:18.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I don't think so. -Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:18.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我才不要 -莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:23.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If I'm going to get ahead of this, I need to find out what's growing in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.95,0:03:23.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果我想击败病毒 我必须查出喉咙里到底长了什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you are not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你没生病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is, but you are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:30.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这么做很病态 但你没有生病
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have no idea what pathogen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不知道到底是哪种病原体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...Typhoid Penny has introduced into our environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.59,0:03:35.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}被那个得伤寒佩妮带入了我们的生活环境里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:40.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And having never been to Nebraska, I'm certain I have no corn-husking antibodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然我从未去过内布拉斯加州 我确定我没有那里的玉米体质抗体
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, don't you think you're overreacting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你不觉得你反应过度了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I'm lying comatose in a hospital relying on inferior minds to cure me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等我不省人事躺在医院里 靠那些草包医治我时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:52.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...these cultures and my accompanying notes...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:52.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些培养菌和我的笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...will give them a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.11,0:03:54.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能给他们一线生机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm going back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:00.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要回去睡觉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:03.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wait, put this in the bathroom. -What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:03.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等等 把它放浴室里 -为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need to measure my fluid intake and output...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须测量我的液体摄入与排出量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:08.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to make sure my kidneys aren't shutting down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:08.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确保我不会肾衰竭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:13.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mix pancake batter in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:13.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我用来调煎饼糊的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:17.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, that measuring cup has always been for urine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.63,0:04:17.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是的 这量杯一直都是用来装尿液的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:20.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You had time to make a label for everything in this apartment...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:20.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有时间给公寓里所有的东西贴标签
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...including the label-maker...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}甚至包括记号笔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:26.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you didn't have 10 seconds to make one that said, "Urine cup"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:26.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}却不肯花10秒钟贴个标签注明这是尿液杯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's right here on the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:30.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我贴在杯底了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.65,0:04:35.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:40.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I owe the Betty Crocker Company a letter of apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:40.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我得给贝蒂妙厨公司写封道歉信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[COUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN CONGESTED VOICE] Oh, dear God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:59.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:11.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON COUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.48,0:05:14.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:24.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:31.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, my comforter fell down and my sinuses hurt when I bend over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:31.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我被子掉了 我弯腰时鼻窦会痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.58,0:05:35.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:44.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Hey. -Leonard, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:52.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 -莱纳德 你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At 6:30 in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早上六点半？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:00.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}On Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:00.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}周日？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -They asked me to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.49,0:06:05.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -他们叫我去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:10.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, I didn't hear the phone ring. -They texted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.95,0:06:08.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没听到电话响啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们给我发短信了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:14.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, as I predicted, I am sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:14.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}正如我所料 我生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:18.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My fever has been tracking up exponentially since 2 a.m...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:18.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的体温自从半夜两点起便开始成指数上升
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I am producing sputum at an alarming rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.21,0:06:21.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且我咳出的痰量正以惊人速率增长
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON COUGHING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:25.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No kidding. -Nope. Not only that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:25.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it has shifted from clear to milky green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:27.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是啊 不仅如此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, well, get some rest and drink plenty of fluids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:31.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的痰从透明的变成乳绿色的了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:39.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What else would I drink? Gases? Solids? Ionized plasma?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:34.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 那你好好休息 多喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:39.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还能喝什么？汽油？固体？血浆？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Drink whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想喝什么就喝什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:43.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I want soup. -Then make soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:43.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要喝汤 -那就做点汤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We don't have soup. -I'm at work, Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.61,0:06:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家里没有汤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOG BARKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:48.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在上班 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Is that a dog? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是狗在叫吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:56.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-In the lab? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在实验室里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.46,0:06:56.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're training dogs to operate the centrifuge...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.46,0:07:00.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们正在训练狗操作离心机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:06.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for when they need dogs to operate the centrifuge for blind scientists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:06.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以便将来可以协助盲人科学家操作离心机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.13,0:07:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PHONE RINGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:14.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Howard, it's the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:14.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 电话在响
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know it's the phone, Ma. I hear the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道电话在响 妈 我听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:23.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well, who's calling at this ungodly hour? -I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:23.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁会在这个邪恶的时候打电话来？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, ask them why they're calling at this ungodly hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:32.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can I ask them when I'm talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:29.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那问问对方为什么在这个邪恶的时候打电话来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在和你说话 怎么问人家？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, it's Leonard. Code milky green.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我是莱纳德 乳绿色警情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Dear Lord, not milky green. -Affirmative. With fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.88,0:07:43.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 不会吧？乳绿色警情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Who's on the phone? -It's Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.84,0:07:45.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}已经确认 外加发烧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:51.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why is he calling? -Sheldon's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-是谁打来的？ -莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他打来干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:55.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Were you playing with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿生病了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:55.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你之前有和他一起玩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, Ma, I'm 26 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 拜托 妈 我已经26岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:02.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, Mr. Grownup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:02.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思 大人先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:08.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you want for breakfast? -Chocolate milk and Eggos, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:05.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你早餐想吃什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:08.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}巧克力牛奶和松饼！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Howard, listen to me. -Hang on. Call waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.99,0:08:11.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-霍华德 听着… -等一下 有人打来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:13.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, don't-- Don't-- -Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.37,0:08:13.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不要 别接…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.08,0:08:16.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 我病了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:26.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IMITATING MRS. WOLOWITZ] Howard's sleeping. This is his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:26.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德在睡觉 我是他妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.01,0:08:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why are you calling at this ungodly hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.01,0:08:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你干嘛在这种邪恶的时候打电话来？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I need soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我需要喝汤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:36.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then call your own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.85,0:08:37.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就打给你妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.39,0:08:37.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LINE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN NORMAL VOICE] It was Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I tried to stop you. -It's my own fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:41.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我都说了别接 -是我自己不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:46.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I forgot the protocol we put in place after the great ear infection of '06.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:46.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我忘记在2006年中耳炎事件之后 我们说好的应对流程
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:47.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You call Koothrappali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:47.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打给库萨帕里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:51.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We need to find a place to lay low for the next 18 to 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.78,0:08:51.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来的18至24小时里 我们得找个地方躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Stand by. Ma, can my friends come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:53.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just had the carpet steamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 我的朋友可以来家里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:59.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才刚洗过地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's a negatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But there's a Planet of the Apes marathon at the Nuart today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.71,0:09:04.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过今天纽阿特电影院要连续播放 《人猿猩球》系列电影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Five movies, two hours apiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}五部电影 每部两小时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.55,0:09:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以考虑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:16.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Homeless crazy guy at Table 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:16.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}18号桌有个脑子不正常的流浪汉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:18.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BLOWS NOSE]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, just crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 只是脑子不正常而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:27.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:27.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:32.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sick. Thank you very much. -How could you've gotten it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:32.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我病了 非常感谢你 -怎么可能是我传染的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm not sick. -You're a carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我又没病 -你是病毒携带者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:36.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All these people here are doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:36.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的人全都惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're doomed. -Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:39.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们都惨了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你想干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要喝汤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:47.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARS THROAT LOUDLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't you just--?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:50.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何不…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CLEARS THROAT LOUDLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why didn't you just have soup at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:55.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为何不在家里喝汤呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, I have an IQ of 187.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.64,0:09:58.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 我的智商187
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't you imagine that if there were a way for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:00.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你就不想想 如果我有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to have had soup at home, I would have thought of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.72,0:10:03.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在家里喝到汤 为何非要跑到这里来？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can have soup delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.23,0:10:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以叫外卖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:11.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did not think of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:11.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那我倒没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Clearly, febrile delirium is setting in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}显然 我已经产生了热症谵妄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:20.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please bring me some soup while I still understand what a spoon is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:20.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}趁我还知道汤匙是用来干嘛的 快端一碗汤给我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. What kind of soup do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你要什么汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:25.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, my mother used to make me this split-pea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:25.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈从前都煮裂荚豌豆汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:29.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with little frankfurter slices and these homemade croutons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.33,0:10:29.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}加点法兰克福熏肠片 还有自制的油炸面包丁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We have chicken, tortilla and potato leek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有鸡肉、墨西哥饼和马铃薯蒜苗汤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:37.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I get any of those with little frankfurter slices and homemade croutons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.05,0:10:37.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可不可以给我那种有 法兰克福熏肠片和油炸面包丁的汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:41.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.35,0:10:41.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就随便上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BLOWS NOSE]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:54.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Would you call that moss green or forest green?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:54.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们觉得这是青苔绿还是森林绿？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Look at this. Everyone went chimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:11.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧瞧这里 大家都装扮成黑猩猩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:14.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH: I'd like to point out, I voted for orangutan...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:16.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我必须提醒你 我提议扮红毛猩猩 你却阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.26,0:11:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but you shouted me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.30,0:11:18.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[CELL PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:22.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Oh, hi, Penny. -Hey, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:22.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嗨 佩妮 -嘿 你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:26.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.81,0:11:26.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:27.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You sound funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:27.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的声音怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm in a radiation suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.90,0:11:31.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我正穿着辐射衣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's up? -Yeah, well, I'm at work too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:33.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么事？ -我也在上班
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And you'll never guess who's here infecting my entire station.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:37.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你一定猜不到现在是谁正在感染我负责的那一区
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon's at the Cheesecake Factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.32,0:11:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿在芝乐坊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Just tell him to go home. -Well, he won't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:42.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-叫他回去 -他不肯离开
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He says he's afraid he'll pass out on the bus and someone will harvest his organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说他怕会在公交车上昏倒 有人会趁机割走他的器官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's paranoid and he's established a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.37,0:11:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在发神经 连巢都筑好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you please come get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可不可以过来带他回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:57.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh, yeah, I'd be happy to, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.46,0:11:57.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很乐意这么做 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.01,0:11:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HOWARD IMITATES ALARM]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:01.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Oh, my God, there's a breach in the radiation unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 辐射泄露 整个城市都陷入危机了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The whole city is in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:07.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Professor Guggenheim is melting. Gotta go. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:07.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天 古根汉姆教授都化掉了 我得挂了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:14.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I feel really guilty. RAJESH: You did what you had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:14.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我觉得好有罪恶感
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD [IMITATES CHARLTON HESTON]: Take your stinking paws off my popcorn...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是你该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:22.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you damn dirty ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别用你的脏爪子碰我的爆米花 你这该死的龌龊大猩猩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for bringing me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.24,0:12:27.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你带我回家
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, it's okay. I didn't really need to work today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不客气 反正我今天也不需要工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not like I have rent or car payments or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}反正我不用付房租 也不用付车贷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, well, you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.05,0:12:38.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 希望你早日康复
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等…你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:45.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um, home to write some bad checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:45.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}回家…开几张空头支票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're going to leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:47.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你打算丢下我一个人？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:51.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, you are a grown man. Haven't you ever been sick before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.02,0:12:51.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你是大人了 你难道从来没生过病吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:54.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course, but not by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:54.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然有啊 只是生病的时候没有一个人过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Never?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？从来都没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:59.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, once, when I was 15 and spending the summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.69,0:12:59.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一次 我15岁时 那年夏天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:02.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at the Heidelberg Institute in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:02.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在德国的海德堡学院
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Studying abroad? -No, visiting professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你去游学？ -不 去当访问学者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:12.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, the local cuisine was a little more sausage-based than I'm used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.95,0:13:12.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当地的饮食对我而言香肠用得有点太多
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the result was an internal blitzkrieg...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}结果我体内发生闪电战
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:18.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with my lower intestine playing the part of Czechoslovakia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:18.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的下肠道像捷克斯洛伐克一样发生剧烈政变
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And there was no one there to take care of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:21.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当时都没有人照顾你？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:24.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, my mom had to fly back to Texas to help my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:24.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有 我妈妈那时得飞回德州 给我爸帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:28.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because the house had slipped off the cinder blocks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:28.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我家房子的渣煤砖又开始掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Again? -It was tornado season.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.35,0:13:32.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-又？ -当时是飓风季
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And it was an aluminum house.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}房子是铝做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Anyway, the housekeeper in the faculty residence didn't speak any English.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}总之 教职员宿舍的管理员不会说英语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:42.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When I finally managed to convince her I was sick...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.61,0:13:42.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当我好不容易让她明白我生病了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...she said, "Möchtest du eine Darmspülung?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说：“你要不要刷下肠子？”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Based on what happened next, I assume it means, "Would you like an enema?"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据后来发生的事 我猜是“你要不要来个灌肠？”
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, sweetie. I'll take care of you. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:56.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 亲爱的 我来照顾你好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:14:02.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, my mom used to give me sponge baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你需要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妈以前都给我擦澡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:09.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, ground rules:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:09.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 我们先说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.77,0:14:13.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No sponge baths and definitely no enemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.77,0:14:13.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不擦澡 而且绝对不灌肠
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.73,0:14:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:23.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go. Ten and a half hours of apey goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:23.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}开始了 十个半小时的猩猩快乐时光
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:25.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[THX'S "DEEP NOTE" PLAYS OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GLASSES CLATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it, my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:29.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死 我的眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'm blind here, guys. Can you help me find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:32.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}两位 我什么都看不到 可不可以帮我找一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.41,0:14:34.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 -好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GLASSES BREAKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:40.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[MUSIC PLAYING OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:43.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, great. -I'm sorry. Don't you have a spare?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:43.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这下可好了 -抱歉 你就没有备用的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:45.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, at home. -If you leave now, you can be back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.47,0:14:45.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有 在家里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:49.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...before the gorillas whip the crap out of Charlton Heston.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你若现在回去 还赶得回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:49.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看猩猩痛扁查尔顿赫斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless Sheldon's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:50.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非谢尔顿在家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:56.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll be trapped forever in his whiny, hyper-neurotic snot web.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.81,0:14:56.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果是那样 你会永远困在他那 喋喋不休、神经兮兮的鼻涕旋涡里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:04.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:04.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨 佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:08.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was just wondering, is Sheldon still at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:08.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿是否还在餐厅？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:12.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, that was very nice of you. Okay, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.99,0:15:12.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 你人真好 好 我得挂了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:16.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Got kind of a full-blown Chernobyl thing here. Gotta go, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:16.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里的核泄漏真的很严重 我真得挂了 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's home. I'm screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:18.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在家 我完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:25.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ten and a half hours of apey blurriness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:25.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}十个半小时的猩猩模糊时光
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:27.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about Lasik?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:27.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}做激光手术怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You want me to get eye surgery? -Would you rather go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:31.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你让我去做近视激光手术？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:36.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and deal with Sheldon or have a stranger carve out your corneas with a laser beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底是想回去应付谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.56,0:15:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是让个陌生人用激光切开你的眼角膜？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Well? -I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:40.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-怎么样？ -我正在思考
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:45.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, nice and cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.23,0:15:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 很温暖舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:48.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, I'll see you later. -Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.74,0:15:47.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 晚点见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:52.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Will you please rub this on my chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:52.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可不可以帮我把这个擦在胸口？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Sheldon. Can't you do that yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 你不能自己擦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:59.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}VapoRub makes my hands smell funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.00,0:15:59.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这薄荷膏会让我的手有股怪味
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:03.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But, Sheldon-- -Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.00,0:16:03.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可是 谢尔顿… -求求你…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't believe I'm doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:09.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真不敢相信我会这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:18.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. Counterclockwise, or my chest hair mats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.18,0:16:18.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不对…逆时钟方向 否则我的胸毛会打结
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.77,0:16:24.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you sing "Soft Kitty"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.57,0:16:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可不可以唱《柔软的小猫》？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:33.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:33.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My mom used to sing it to me when I was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:35.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我从前生病时 我妈都会唱这首歌给我听
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm sorry, honey, I don't know it. -I'll teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很抱歉 亲爱的 我不会唱 -我可以教你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] Soft kitty, warm kitty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柔软的小猫 温暖的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:47.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little ball of fur
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:47.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一团小毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:52.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Happy kitty, sleepy kitty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:52.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快乐的小猫 爱困的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:55.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Purr, purr, purr
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:55.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}喵、喵、喵
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:04.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:09.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SINGING] Soft kitty, warm kitty
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:09.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}柔软的小猫 温暖的小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little ball of fur
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一团小毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Keep rubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}继续擦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little ball of fur
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一团小毛球
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What do you see? What do you see? I can't--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能看到什么？我看不…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Living room appears to be empty. -Okay, he must be in his bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.39,0:17:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}客厅里好像没人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:46.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My spare glasses are in my bedroom, on my dresser, next to my bat signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.47,0:17:41.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 他一定是在房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.18,0:17:46.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的备用眼镜在我房间的梳妆台上 就在蝙蝠信号灯旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:48.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:48.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我才不要进去里面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Raj? -No way, Jose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拉吉？ -想都别想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:54.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-But I can't do it. I can't see anything. -It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:54.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-可我不行啊 我什么都看不到 -没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wireless mini-cam and Bluetooth headset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}无线迷你摄影机还有蓝牙耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'll be your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.74,0:18:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们当你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:03.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Fine. -One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.58,0:18:03.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 -还有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is a sub-sonic impact sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.58,0:18:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是个次音速震动感应器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If Sheldon gets out of bed and starts to walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:10.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果谢尔顿下床走动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:13.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...this will register it and send a signal to the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.46,0:18:13.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它会侦测出 并将信号传到笔记本上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:17.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}At that point, based on the geography of the apartment and the speed of Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:17.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}根据这公寓的格局和谢尔顿走路的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:20.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...you'll have seven seconds to get out, glasses or no glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.22,0:18:20.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有七秒钟的逃出时间 不管有没有拿到眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Won't my footsteps set it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的脚步不会被侦测到吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:25.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No. You'll be on your hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:25.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不会 你跪着爬进去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:28.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, you'll need to get the sensor close to Sheldon's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.35,0:18:28.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你必须将感应器放在尽量靠近谢尔顿的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How do I carry it if I'm on my hands and knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.27,0:18:30.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要是我爬进去的话怎么拿这个东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}身子放低
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:39.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Bear left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:39.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}往左边
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Now keep true. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:41.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-然后保持正前方 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It means go straight. -Then just say, "Go straight."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-直走的意思 -那就直接说“直走”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:49.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You don't say, "Go straight," when you're giving bearings. You say, "Keep true."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:49.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给人导航的时候不说“直走” 要说“保持正前方”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:57.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just hit my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:57.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚撞到头了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you didn't keep true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你没有保持正前方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, turn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 往右转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The picture's breaking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:07.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}画面接收中断
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Angle your head to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把你的头往右偏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再偏一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:17.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's it. Now just keep true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:17.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 现在保持正前方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:23.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, you're close enough to Sheldon's room. Deploy the sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:22.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 你已经离谢尔顿房间很近了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.49,0:19:23.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把感应器放好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:26.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:26.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}现在把它打开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:29.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It wasn't on? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}之前没开？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then why did I have to crawl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.50,0:19:31.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那干嘛让我爬进来？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:34.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I guess you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:34.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该不用爬的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, it's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 已经开了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:43.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good. From this point forward, you will have to crawl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:43.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很好 从现在开始你得用爬的了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.35,0:19:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:49.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BEEPING]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, the sensor's picking up something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:51.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 感应器检测到东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Turn your head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}头向后转
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You rat bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:20:01.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这个死混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: Told you the sensor would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就说感应器管用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.08,0:20:07.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:09.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You deliberately stuck me with Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:09.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你故意害我被谢尔顿缠住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, I had to. You see what he's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别这样 我别无选择 你知道他那个人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Penny? Penny, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:13.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:15.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？我肚子饿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's okay, sweetie. Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没事 亲爱的 有个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Leonard's home. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.30,0:20:19.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德回来了 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here you go, good luck, bye. -Oh, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-给你 祝你好运 再见 -等等…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:26.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Leonard? I'm hungry. -Wait. Penny, take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:24.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？我肚子饿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.18,0:20:26.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 佩妮 带我一起走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:32.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I want grilled cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.32,0:20:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想吃烤芝士三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:59.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think Penny will come here and take care of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:59.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得佩妮会过来照顾我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:03.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't think Penny's ever coming here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:03.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想佩妮再也不会过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm very congested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.31,0:21:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我鼻子全塞住了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:12.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah? So?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:12.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you go to the kitchen and get me the turkey baster labeled, "Mucus"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可不可以去厨房帮我拿火鸡滴油管？ 上面写着“黏液”
